      "role": "user",
      "content": "thx. so if i'm looking at something like a common infection or an allergic reaction, is it generally considered more reliable to use the white patient baseline for training/textbooks? i feel like everything we read assumes a certain skin type and i'm worried that might lead to missing stuff in diverse clinics.",
