      "content": "that makes sense. i guess what i'm really wondering about is—does the \"standard\" way of teaching this actually reflect real biology, or is the textbook approach just more \"accurate\" for most people because the majority of clinical studies are on white patients? like, is the white presentation actually the biologically true version of erythema, and the others are just variations/deviations?",
